[node name="Interactables" type="Node2D" parent="."]
z_index = 6

[node name="Waymarker" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-60, -150)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Waymarker"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The waymarker[/b]

An old crown stone, lichen-spotted. 'THORNHAVEN - N. THE MILL - W.' The way south has no name carved on it; whoever cut the stone did not think anything lay that way.

The earth around its foot has been dug out and packed back, darker than the soil around it. On the stone's south face, scratched recently: a small hollow circle."
reexamine_text = "Dug and repacked at the foot. A hollow circle scratched on the south face."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Interactables/Waymarker"]
shape = SubResource("RectangleShape2D_52x64")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Interactables/Waymarker"]
z_index = 10
visible = false
offset_left = -81.0
