offset_right = 81.0
offset_bottom = -18.0
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 1)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Read the Waymarker"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="FeverRoot" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = -8
position = Vector2(300, 230)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Search the Wet Ground"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]Under the ash trees[/b]

The ground under the ashes is black and sodden, and it smells of rot and something sharper. Pale, hair-fine roots break the surface between the leaf litter, bitter on the tongue even from the smell. Fever-root, if the old women's tales are right.

Someone has been digging here, carelessly, with a knife, and left the holes open. Whoever it was was in a hurry, or afraid of being seen."
reexamine_text = "Pale fever-root threads the black mud under the ashes. The old dig holes are still open."

