text = "[E] Search the Wet Ground"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="Tripwire" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-8, 110)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Path"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A wire across the road[/b]

Ankle-high, strung between two stakes and darkened with soot so it will not catch the light: a tripwire. Beyond it lies a farmer's cart on its side, one wheel smashed, turnips spilled and gnawed by deer. No sign of the farmer. No sign of his horse.

The Hollow does not rob this road. It owns it."
reexamine_text = "A sooted tripwire, a wrecked cart, and no farmer."

