[node name="LookoutPerch" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(220, -185)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("5_story_item")
interaction_name = "Examine the Fire"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A lookout's fire[/b]

A ring of cold ashes, carefully small. Above it, lashed into the fork of a pine, a plank perch with a clear view of the road both ways. Tallow drippings, a carved dice cup, and a tally cut in the bark: travellers counted, day by day.

Men watch this road in shifts. Varn's men."
reexamine_text = "A watch-perch over the road, a dice cup, and a tally of everyone who passed."

